{"id":"fwedtb2h01s83ue62h2rdkx2d","title":"阿斯利康泰适卓®首次被纳入中国基本医保目录","originalTitle":"阿斯利康：泰适卓®首次被纳入基本医保药品目录","summary":"阿斯利康宣布其呼吸领域创新生物制剂泰适卓®（特泽利尤单抗注射液）于2026年11月14日首次被纳入国家基本医保药品目录。该药品于2026年3月获批上市，用于成人及青少年重度哮喘维持治疗，以及与鼻用糖皮质激素联合治疗慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉成人患者。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15333634.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T11:13:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T11:41:24.232Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T11:41:24.232Z","category":"macro","tags":["政策发布"],"score":64,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"1743850b-4c39-4a39-898a-86e144a1641a","title":"阿斯利康泰适卓®首进中国医保目录"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(界面)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"1743850b-4c39-4a39-898a-86e144a1641a","title":"阿斯利康泰适卓®首进中国医保目录"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fbshUjL6LNrU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}